# Top Weekly Headlines
Friday, 13 November 2026

###
## Microsoft teaches schools that free email was just a phase
 Office 365 A1 and Student Use Benefit face retirement, leaving
institutions to budget for paid replacements at renewal=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q3r?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Dtop-article
