## Smart meters to cost the UK billions: 2G switch-off means replacing
## 12-13 million
 Sunset of legacy cellphone tech means forced upgrade for many millions
of smart energy meter users=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q3C?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Apple tells its Support Community to STFU
 User-to-user forum goes read-only ahead of November 20 closure, with
archive's fate unclear=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q4A?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Outlook.com bounces legit emails as Microsoft's authentication
