 Missing DMARC or wobbly SPF means your mail may be treated as
suspicious=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q2Z?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Linux joins Heathrow's grounded fleet of information screens
 Anything Windows can bork, the penguin can bork sideways=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q4t?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Linus Torvalds sees signs AI-prompted patch flood has peaked
