m_content=3Darticle

## Dev error bricked 600 PCs, caused $1M CD-ROM write-off
 One lucky engineer scored a free dinner during the frantic fix, the
rest got to explain their mistake=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q2F?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Crowd fave Linux Mint update approaches, fresh from autumn release
