 Mint 27 to land before Christmas, with stable Wayland display
upgrades, as punters try out Cinnamon 6.8=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q24?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Microsoft is giving Claude the keys to UK Copilot tenants by default
 Admins have until December 9 to review access settings as Anthropic
processes data in the US=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q3y?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## US air traffic control enters the 21st century, starts to abandon
## floppy disks
 The FAA will need to come up with more money to finish the wider
overhaul, though=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q2e?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## RIP to the world=E2=80=99s ugliest car
