 Hasn't completely ruled out cyberattack as cause of incident that's
damaged Exchange Online and services that rely on it=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q68?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle

## Bank of England pours cold water on AI productivity boom
 Turns out throwing billions at GPUs doesn't automatically mean
everyone gets more done=20
https://go.reg.cx/twdml/4q1W?utm_source=3Ddigest&utm_medium=3Dnewsletter&ut=
m_content=3Darticle


## 14-year-old creates tool for AI agents to band together like a team
 Autark can act without constant prompting, but leaves users to enforce
